OL,3,GNEWSAEverything you need to know about
OL,4,AHull Fair
OL,5,
OL,6,FA slight chill in the air can only mean
OL,7,Fone thing ` it is nearly time for Hull
OL,8,FFair to fill the city with its striking
OL,9,Fneon lights, waft of burger vans and
OL,10,Fexcited screams.
OL,12,FThe centuries-old annual event, which
OL,13,Fincludes more than 250 rides and
OL,14,Fattractions, will return to Walton
OL,15,FStreet on 9 October and run until 17
OL,16,FOctober.
OL,18,FEstablished in 1278 and one of the
OL,19,Flargest travelling fairs in Europe,
OL,20,Flast year saw more than 500,000 people
OL,21,Fattend the event.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
