OL,3,GNEWSAEverything you need to know about
OL,4,AHull Fair
OL,5,
OL,6,FHelen Thackeray, events manager at Hull
OL,7,FCity Council, said: "The fair is an
OL,8,Fabsolutely wonderful spectacle for the
OL,9,Fcity."
